# 301 redirects — Cloudflare Pages membaca file ini dari root output (dist/).
#
# Konsolidasi service routes ke SINGULAR canonical (lihat
# docs/reports/service-listing-visual-audit.md §C-opsi 1 + hardcoded-pages-audit.md §C.1).
# Plural = redirect ke singular. /yacht TIDAK di sini (sudah CMS landing page).

# ── Listing roots (exact): plural → singular CMS landing page ──
/tours               /tour            301
/accommodations      /villa           301
/restaurants         /restaurant      301
/rentals             /rental          301
/weddings            /venue           301
/water-activities    /water-activity  301

# ── Detail routes (splat): plural/[slug] → singular/[slug] ──
/tours/*             /tour/:splat            301
/accommodations/*    /villa/:splat           301
/restaurants/*       /restaurant/:splat      301
/rentals/*           /rental/:splat          301
/weddings/*          /venue/:splat           301
/water-activities/*  /water-activity/:splat  301
